id: pm-sew1dj
title: "A history entry whose agent_harness is not a string crashes pm activity --raw, provenance reads and pm context with unknown_error"
description: "Found by the Codex review of the pm-gh1664 change on 2026-11-20 and reproduced against the released 2026.11.20 build: in a fresh tracker, a history stream holding one entry with agent_harness: 42 makes pm activity --raw --limit 3 --json exit 1 with code unknown_error (a TypeError, entry.agent_harness?.trim is not a function). resolveCanonicalHarness in src/sdk/history-provenance.ts called .trim() on any truthy recorded value, and runActivity applies compileHistoryProvenanceMatcher to every row even without a provenance filter, so one malformed row from an import, a hand edit or another writer took down every activity read that projects provenance, and the pm context activity section with it (it used runActivity before pm-gh1664). An unclassified TypeError is also the kind of crash that reaches Sentry as an unexpected fault. Duplicate check: searched agent_harness, provenance, non-string harness, trim crash and unknown_error activity; no item owns it."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[6]: activity,crash,history,provenance,robustness,sentry
created_at: "2026-11-20T11:44:46.491Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-20T14:31:22.483Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-20T12:31:04.746Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-20T12:31:04.746Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: "A recorded agent_harness that is not a string is ignored rather than trimmed: the author's vocabulary alias resolves the harness when one matches (harness_source vocabulary), and the harness is otherwise unresolved; runActivity in every mode, readRecentActivity, provenance projection and summaries return the row instead of throwing; pm activity --raw returns the malformed row; a spec reproduces the crash shape"
parent: pm-33cw
risk: low
confidence: high
severity: medium
repro_steps: "pm init; write a history entry with agent_harness: 42 to .agents/pm/history/pm-x.jsonl; run pm activity --raw --limit 3 --json"
resolution: "resolveCanonicalHarness in src/sdk/history-provenance.ts requires a string before trimming, so runActivity in every mode, readRecentActivity, provenance projection and summaries return the malformed row with harness_source unresolved"
expected_result: "A malformed recorded harness falls back to vocabulary resolution, or to unresolved provenance when no alias matches"
actual_result: "The spec writes agent_harness 42 and gets the row from raw, recent and provenance reads, where the released 2026.11.20 build exits 1 with unknown_error"
affected_version: 2026.11.20
component: activity
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
