comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-20T14:31:22.482Z","harness:claude-code","CodeRabbit (review of 1b1bd929c) pointed out that the close text overstated the outcome. A non-string recorded harness is ignored, so an author with a vocabulary alias still resolves as harness_source vocabulary; unresolved applies only when no alias matches. The acceptance criteria and expected result now say so. The spec's author has no alias, so its unresolved assertion is that fallback."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
